      "content": "doctor, professionals... it's all just more work. another person to explain myself to, another appointment, another way to fail. i feel like i'm just a shell. like there's no version of the future where i'm not just this exhausted, broken person. it feels like the only way to actually get peace is maybe just... letting go. does that even make sense? to just want it all to stop?",
